name: probe (named only): the Faction tab's first row hovered and clicked, to see whether a client turned its rows on (a row on has its 'Reaction : x' tooltip and, clicked, fills the panel's name and description); 2026-11-19 E2, pda_faction's shot DIFF
timeout: 400
include _login
key 0x59
expect-event proxy '^input: replayed key 0x59'
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
click gadget pda.char.faction
wait-quiet proxy 0.7 within 15
move 160,440
alive 2
shot faction_row_hover
click 160,440
wait-quiet proxy 0.7 within 15
alive 1
shot faction_row_clicked
click gadget pda.char.skills
wait-quiet proxy 0.7 within 15
key 0x59
wait-quiet proxy 0.7 within 15
